# `streamed` is what GStreamer 1.26.2 writes for
#     audiotestsrc num-buffers=3 samplesperbuffer=960 ! audioconvert
#       ! opusenc bitrate=6000
#       ! webmmux streamable=true max-cluster-duration=20000000
# Unable to seek, it leaves the Segment's size and every Cluster's at all ones,
# so each Cluster ends before the next one's ID or at the end of the file.
# ffprobe reads its four packets as 19, 35, 36 and 21 bytes: the first three
# are the SimpleBlocks' 23, 39 and 40 less their four-byte headers.
